{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06271","headline":"长安道 · 崔颢","name":"长安道","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长安甲第高入云，谁家居住霍将军。\n日晚朝回拥宾从，路傍揖拜何纷纷。\n莫言炙手手可热，须臾火尽灰亦灭。\n莫言贫贱即可欺，人生富贵自有时。\n一朝天子赐眼色，世上悠悠应始知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔颢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06271.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06271","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}